  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Rule - does the steersman lay her course again himself","summary":"Wind and tide have set her well off her line. Does the steersman lay her course again himself, with the clock running on, or does he tell her and leave it to her? The game asks this graph the moment she is set that far off (GameRules.LaysAgainHimself, from Adrift.Carry).","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"0e985fc5-6ba9-49e6-9820-84fed6335aab","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LaysAgainRule","$id":"9"},{"how":"AtLeast","defaultValues":{"a":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"b":{"$content":0.5,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":520.0,"y":20.0},"guid":"86019695-3ab2-4645-b9ba-d56bff336b58","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.IsIt","$id":"11"},{"how":"AtLeast","defaultValues":{"a":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"b":{"$content":0.5,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":520.0,"y":200.0},"guid":"693f4faf-d6af-4a4c-b9e3-2759a2a058ea","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.IsIt","$id":"13"},{"how":"FirstAndNotSecond","defaultValues":{"one":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"other":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":840.0,"y":100.0},"guid":"ebeb5b4f-f372-4883-b92e-c0a79bf490f6","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.BothOrEither","$id":"15"},{"defaultValues":{"when":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"yes":{"$content":1.0,"$type":"System.Double"},"no":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":1280.0,"y":100.0},"guid":"15e44f55-a9aa-4e20-bd84-be30a76e7c7d","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.ThisOrThat","$id":"17"},{"defaultValues":{"number":{"$content":0.0,"$type":"System.Double"}},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"23676b74-cc68-4525-94bb-1775c026fc2b","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.RuleAnswer","$id":"19"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"d6b1d067-7dac-492f-85eb-bd77aafc1972","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"land","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"49388f98-91d6-45f4-b238-7ddfe39532c4","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"thick","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"a","guid":"a5ecb108-6844-4d3a-9080-b5e01a60965a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"one","guid":"9431ad3d-20ef-49f0-bace-c48191f5c668","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"other","guid":"40834317-4d04-4ed9-8db9-b7ebbbe26965","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"sourceKey":"so","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"destinationKey":"when","guid":"f33dac69-dc75-4af9-8c40-a34b3c742bc1","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"sourceKey":"picked","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"destinationKey":"number","guid":"a74aa270-91c2-415c-a9bd-9a92cb35c883","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-80.0,"xMax":1960.0,"yMax":440.0},"label":"Does he lay her course again himself","comment":"Your ruling of 10 October 2026: with the land in sight he does. Out of sight of land it is yours to lay. In thick air he cannot see the land, so there too he tells you.","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"bb8569a2-6b95-4a51-9cf0-2641b75a32f8","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":320.0,"xMax":600.0,"yMax":450.0},"title":"What the game gives","body":"Land is in sight: she is on a coast''s own lane, or dry land lies within as far as he makes out a landfall now (30 km by day, 12 km by night). The air is thick: he makes out a landfall at under a kilometre (fog, heavy rain).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"e2d557ad-4689-46f9-82d4-c6da063641cf","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
